================================================================================
Required external tooling (NOT bundled with this software)
================================================================================

ConfigForge integrates with the Microsoft OSConfig CLI (`oscfg`) for
deploying and auditing security baseline manifests on Windows and Linux. As of
v0.2.0, the `oscfg` binary is NOT bundled with this software and is NOT
redistributed by this project. Users install OSConfig separately from its
upstream source:

  https://github.com/microsoft/osconfig

See INSTALL.md at the repo root for platform-by-platform install steps.

The OSConfig CLI is owned, licensed, and maintained by Microsoft Corporation.
Refer to the upstream OSConfig repository for its license and trademark terms.


